WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
Welcome to Business Readiness Scorecard Pro. I’m Brian

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:07.200
Kennedy Jr. Your goal is one evidence-backed improvement

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.320
plan. Choose one business pillar and identify the

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.160
current record you could use to check your

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.880
rating. Keep your work private, record what you

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.440
tried, and set a review date. A readiness

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.120
score is educational, not loan approval, a valuation

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.760
or a validated prediction of business success.
